id: chrome-history
section: Chrome, menus and dialogs
item: The card's bookmarks and history button opens its panel over the page, a tap outside takes it away and a plain tap afterwards reaches the page
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-long-static.html
kit: cavekit-device-build.md R4
calibrate 'sel:#content p'
sample page 0,100,756,960
chrome history
wait differs 0,100,756,960 page 5
shoot history-panel
dismiss 100 500
wait still 0,100,756,960 5
tap 'sel:#content p:nth-child(5)'
expect hit 'sel:#content p:nth-child(5)'
